    "title": "MICROSERVICE-apiwizdoc-List Rideshare Rides Historys-v1-spec",
    "description": "The Rideshare Ride History API provides access to the historical data of rides within the rideshare service. Users can retrieve detailed records of their previously completed rides, including pickup and drop-off locations, timestamps, and fare details. This API is particularly useful for both riders and fleet management systems that require insights into usage patterns and financial summaries. Developers can integrate this functionality into consumer apps or back-end services for enhanced user experience and analytics.",
